  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1477036/description_638e488c-48d8-4411-b15f-e274d1cc33fb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"622\" height=\"414\"></p>\n<p><strong>Bosses of Miracle</strong> 為 Minecraft 帶來充滿挑戰的類魂系首領戰</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><strong>首領</strong></span></h1>\n<h2><strong>🗡️劍豪 Kenji</strong></h2>\n<p>位置：主世界（平原生物群系）</p>\n<p><strong>挑戰：</strong>在廣闊的平原中搜尋，尋找流浪的浪人劍術大師<strong>Kenji</strong>。準備好迎戰他電光石火般的劍擊與致命精準的攻擊吧。</p>\n<p><strong>獎勵：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Kenji 的專屬武器。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>🔮 <strong>靈符道具</strong>&mdash; <em>推進終局進程的關鍵製作材料。</em></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1477036/description_6e1a5826-217d-4962-a76e-3657b1427bd5.png\"></em></strong></p>\n<h2><strong>🌀狂戰士 Azrath</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>進入物品：</strong> <strong>虛空羅盤<br><strong>維度：</strong>狂戰領域<br></strong></p>\n<p><strong>戰鬥方式：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>製作虛空羅盤</li>\n<li><strong>右鍵點擊</strong>羅盤以開啟通往狂戰領域黑暗國度的傳送門。</li>\n<li>\n<p>在其領域內召喚<strong>Azrath</strong>，準備好迎接一場兇猛殘酷的戰鬥。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>獎勵：</strong>獨特的首領寶箱與勝利後的特殊掉落物。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1477036/description_ce8afa2c-2b37-4b3b-ad47-580df6002c0e.png\"></p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2><strong>⛩️霸主將軍 Kenshin</strong></h2>\n<p><strong><strong>進入物品：</strong> <strong>霸主徽章</strong><br><strong>維度：</strong>霸主將軍<br></strong></p>\n<p><strong>解鎖方式：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>擊敗<strong>終界龍</strong>以獲得<strong>龍蛋。</strong></li>\n<li>擊敗<strong>劍豪 Kenji</strong>以取得<strong>靈符。</strong></li>\n<li>\n<p>在工作檯中將<strong>龍蛋</strong>與<strong>靈符</strong>組合，製作出<strong>霸主徽章</strong>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>使用<strong>霸主徽章</strong>進入古老維度<strong>霸主將軍之地。</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>獎勵：</strong>最終極的終局獎勵與強力裝備。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1477036/description_2d7c08f6-7995-468c-8403-8c65309e8809.png\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>依賴模組</strong></h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armor-of-the-ages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Armor of the Ages</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod/download/8049910\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Epic Fight 20.14.17</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-nightfall/download/8366962\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>EpicFight-Nightfall 3.4.0</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-extra/download/7961244\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>EpicFight-Extra 1.2</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/combat-evolution/download/8368239\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Combat Evolution 2.2.0</strong></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>原聲帶</strong></h1>\n<p><strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jHSQ2vCIRcc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">最終對決</a></strong></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>創作者 / 頻道：</strong> Tak_mfk</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=C9poAzwBnnA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">天罰審判</a></strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>創作者 / 頻道：</strong> Tak_mfk</li>\n</ul>",
